 inside their workshops for an intimate look at their builds.\n \nAdam Savage\u2019s Tested VR features 12 episodes across two seasons, filmed with 180-degree stereoscopic cameras that allow for an immersive look at the creative process like never before. Bonus footage includes Adam's \"Cave\" workshop tours.\n \nMakers include:\n- Adam Savage, Maker/TV Personality\n- Rick Lyon, Puppeteer & Puppet Designer\n- Marc DeVidts, Robot Maker and Battlebots Competitor\n- Melissa Ng, Gothic Armor Designer\n- Andrew Freeman, Creature Mask Sculptor\n- Griffon Ramsey, Chainsaw Wood Sculptor\n- Alexis Noriega, Costume Wing Designer\n- Ryan Nagata, Spacesuit Replica Fabricator", "short_description": "Adam Savage's Tested takes you inside the workshops and maker spaces of incredible creators to learn their processes and watch their awesome builds."}]}, "developer_name": "WHALEROCK", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.tested.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.tested.com/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Tested.com", "support_website_url": "https://www.tested.com/", "website_url": "https://www.tested.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ART_CREATIVITY", "EDUCATIONAL", "EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "302030535239208"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974519_419988681925238_604568577361575936_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc